Package: libgeocode-glib-2-0
Version: @DEB_GEOCODE-GLIB_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/geocode-glib
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libjson-glib-1.0-0, libsoup-3.0-0
Description: Geocoding convenience library, API 2.0 (build dep of libgweather-4)
 geocode-glib for rootless iOS. Client library for forward/reverse geocoding via
 the Nominatim service. A build dependency of libgweather-4. Built against
 libsoup 3 (-Dsoup2=false), which makes this the geocode-glib-2 API: the dylib is
 libgeocode-glib-2.0.dylib and the pkg-config file is geocode-glib-2.0.pc, and
 the package name matches Debian's libgeocode-glib-2-0.
